description	"Darth Maladi

A master of toxins, torture, and crippling dark side plagues.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% Faster Melee
-- Poison/Cripples On Hit
- Lightsaber (Red/Blue Style)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- Blaster Defense/Deflect (2)
-- Low Saber Damage (100)
-- Applies Poison/Cripple On Hit
-- Saber Throw (3) ^[CS1]
-- Short Length
- Sith Leech Grenades (4)
-- Based On Frag Grenade
-- Poisons/Cripples/Force Focuses/Slips/Life Steals
-- Large Splash Radius, 0 Damage
-- Fast RoF

^5Powers:
- Jump (2)
- Push (2)
- Mind Trick (3)
- Force Grip (3)
- Force Plague (Lightning 1) ^3[CS3]
-- Cripples/Poisons
-- 100% More Damage
- Force Sense (2)

^8Attributes:
- Force Focus (2)
- Sense Immunity
- Force Block (1)
- Acid Blood
- Dexterity (3)
- Anti-Mind Trick (2)
- Blast Armor

^8Abilites:
- Perfected Poison Darts (18) ^3[CS4]
-- Inflict Cripples/Force Focus
- Dash (1) ^3[CS2]"